Description: Private English tutor management application
 Tutor Heaven is a desktop application for managing private English
 tutoring sessions. It tracks student enrollments, class packages,
 session progress, payments, and generates Obsidian-compatible notes.
 .
 Features include:
  * Student enrollment and profile management
  * Hour-based class packages with automatic discounts
  * Session tracking with start/end times
  * Payment management (pay in advance or pay later)
  * Automatic backup to external folder
  * Obsidian vault integration for notes
  * Spanish and English interface
